badajoz95/h-ear  1.1.7 -> 1.1.8
change_type: instructions+code   changelog: Version 1.1.8  - Added new batch classification command: `h-ear classify batch` for submitting multiple audio URLs asynchronously. - Updated documentation to include the new batch operation and clarify webhook callback delivery.

### SKILL.md  [instructions]
+ | `h-ear classify batch` | Submit a batch of audio URLs for asynchronous classification (callback delivery). |

